  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Coterie of the Conceited",
    "summary": "As each battle round begins, if your WARLORD model is currently on the battlefield, a pledge to Slaanesh is required: how many of the enemy's units you predict will be destroyed in that round. When the round ends, if the enemy losses that round match or exceed the pledge, you gain as many Pact points as you pledged; if not, that round brings no Pact points and D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** are inflicted on your WARLORD model. Your EMPEROR’S CHILDREN units get every bonus unlocked by the total Pact points gained so far in the battle, cumulatively. With 1 or more, their attacks re-roll Hit rolls of 1. With 3 or more, they also re-roll Wound rolls of 1. With 5 or more, melee weapons their models are equipped with have **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)** and **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**. With 7 or more, unmodified Hit rolls of 5+ for their attacks score Critical Hits.",
